{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30260","headline":"题上皇观 · 薛逢","name":"题上皇观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"狂寇穷兵犯帝畿，上皇曾此振戎衣。\n门前卫士传清警，砌下奚官扫翠微。\n云驻寿宫三洞啓，日回仙仗六龙归。\n当时丹凤衔书处，老柏苍苍已合围。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30260.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30260","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}